01:11:39,342 --> 01:11:45,604
and yeah, another really fun example of flows, but there's lots and lots of different use cases, whether you're trying to solve some

764
01:11:46,816 --> 01:11:52,736
really important millennium problem, or you're trying to generate video, or you're trying to improve your stock picks or

