01:13:35,776 --> 01:13:40,004
And so you don't really like improve too much over having the single agent.

782
01:13:40,686 --> 01:13:48,708
When we have flows, we have this sort of it's it's not necessarily deterministic, but we have the ability to split up and dedicate

783
01:13:48,976 --> 01:13:58,692
an individual agent context to each of those services. So they're only responsible for their small scope of work, and we can get a much better answer back because we can tell from the flow

784
01:14:00,014 --> 01:14:06,436
fan out across all 50 services and dedicate an agent to each of those services to go and see if that service is healthy.

785
01:14:06,638 --> 01:14:10,308
And by the end, we know for sure that we went and checked every single service.

786
01:14:10,798 --> 01:14:13,936
So this is like the fan out and loop until done kind of like combined.

