01:14:47,502 --> 01:14:49,732
taking advantage of that generator discriminator gap.

795
01:14:50,288 --> 01:14:58,448
But when you have like a really massive problem, you're still gonna like run into this pro this, you'll you'll run into a situation where like you uh you

