01:14:58,608 --> 01:15:08,420
your roster is not gonna like necessarily scale up to a point that you need without having like these separate and distinct kind of like checkpoints.

797
01:15:08,878 --> 01:15:17,572
And so with a flow, we can spread out across lots of these different agents and have like adversarial review that has its own isolated context that isn't being like

